<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>Assigning Order Numbers</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='italic' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>NOTE: Effective July 6 2006, orders are emailed by staff to Cranston Snord, NOT to a specific admin person.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>0. After staff have formulated an order, they press the "Send To Admin" button, which emails a link to the person listed under keyword SendToAdmi, as shown here:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
