><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Due to the frequent change in Admin Personnel and the resulting likelihood of loss of orders etc, Cranston Snord is the recipient of orders.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Therefore, the Section Admin must check Cranston's email at least TWICE daily for new orders requiring action, including but not limited to issuing an order number and faxing to the company.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Click on the link in the email received from the person that placed the order.  This will take you directly to the order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='2'><picture height='104px' width='333px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
