<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Quickly check the order for completness (financial coding is not blank, currency selected, etc.)</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.0021in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  Click on the Got It! button on the action bar.  Wait for the order number to be assigned.  A small pop-up screen will appear that will tell you that an email has been sent to the person that placed the order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
